      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹41.75 (vs ₹23.21 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹41.75 (up from ₹23.21 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹2.14b (up 72% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹424.0m (up 87% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 20% (up from 18% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 54% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 144% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
